Depends: ${misc:Depends}, cockpit, network-manager
# Scorebird-specific, and transitional. Until 2026-07 the NeST firmware shipped this
# plugin's files inside its own nest-cockpit package. Taking ownership of paths another
# installed package owns needs Replaces, or dpkg refuses the unpack with "trying to
# overwrite '/usr/share/cockpit/wifimanager/...', which is also in package
# nest-cockpit". Only upgrades are affected; a fresh install never conflicts.
#
# Bounded at << 3.6.0 so it expires on its own rather than lingering forever. Every
# nest-cockpit that ever shipped these paths is below that: the 3.5.x releases, and the
# 3.6.0~pre* builds, since ~ sorts below the bare version. A released 3.6.0 or later
# does not ship them, so from then on this declaration is inert and can be deleted
# whenever anyone happens to be in here.
#
# Deliberately no Breaks: that would make the co-installed nest-cockpit — which depends
# on this package — look unsatisfiable in the same transaction. Replaces alone is a
# file-ownership override, not a supersession, so both packages stay installed.
Replaces: nest-cockpit (<< 3.6.0)
Description: A simple pluging for Cockpit to manage
  wireless network connections
